anthropic/skills
--------------------------------------------------------------------

Path:    plugins/artagon-multi-agent/bridges/anthropic-skills
         (currently uninitialized — the scripts below are NOT vendored in
         this repo; `tools/skillref` and `tools/skillkit` are the working
         validators)
Source:  https://github.com/anthropics/skills
License: Apache License 2.0

Copyright 2026 Anthropic, PBC.

This project uses the `skill-creator` skill's METHODOLOGY (evaluation,
description optimization) — no skill-creator scripts are invoked at
these paths today. The working tooling:

- `tools/skillref` — schema validator (actively used; `cd tools && uv run python -m skillref validate`)
- `tools/skillkit` — manifest validation, lift gate, corpus audit (actively used)
- `scripts/optimize-skill-descriptions-dspy-gepa.py` — description-optimization loop (actively used)

The additional scripts `aggregate_benchmark.py`, `improve_description.py`,
`package_skill.py`, `generate_report.py` and the subagent prompts under
`agents/` (grader.md, comparator.md, analyzer.md) are available for use
but are not currently invoked by this repository's lifecycle pipeline.
Attribution is extended to the full `skill-creator` tree under its
Apache 2.0 license regardless of which files this repo currently calls.

See README.md § Skill Lifecycle Pipeline.

